WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.580 --> 00:00:06.390
When Spider-Man officially joined the MCU
back in 2015, fans were understandably excited

00:00:06.390 --> 00:00:11.120
about the prospect of seeing some classic
comic book villains finally get some silver

00:00:11.120 --> 00:00:12.190
screen love.

00:00:12.190 --> 00:00:17.210
Those fans got exactly what they wanted too,
with the Vulture appearing as the main antagonist

00:00:17.210 --> 00:00:22.580
in Spider-Man: Homecoming, alongside classic
foes like Shocker and the Tinkerer, shortly

00:00:22.580 --> 00:00:25.930
followed by Mysterio in Spider-Man: Far from
Home.

00:00:25.930 --> 00:00:30.710
Meanwhile, Sony Pictures has attempted to
develop a handful of other Spider-Man villains

00:00:30.710 --> 00:00:36.000
into their own independent projects, starting
with 2018's Venom and continuing with the

00:00:36.000 --> 00:00:38.730
upcoming Jared Leto flick Morbius.

00:00:38.730 --> 00:00:44.120
So far, most of the other Sony Pictures projects,
such as Silver &amp; Black and a solo Mysterio

00:00:44.120 --> 00:00:48.820
film, appear to have vanished into the ether
— but one project that's supposedly still

00:00:48.820 --> 00:00:52.060
a go is the standalone Kraven the Hunter movie.

00:00:52.060 --> 00:00:56.500
Fans have long wanted to see the nefarious
big game hunter on the big screen, but there

00:00:56.500 --> 00:00:59.700
hasn't been all that much news about the project
in recent months.

00:00:59.700 --> 00:01:05.040
A 2020 report from Deadline suggested that
J.C. Chandor was in talks to direct, with

00:01:05.040 --> 00:01:10.180
a script by Equalizer scribe Richard Wenk,
but that was the most recent major development…

00:01:10.180 --> 00:01:11.180
until now.

00:01:11.180 --> 00:01:15.690
That's because, according to a recent rumor
shared by The Illuminerdi, Marvel has allegedly

00:01:15.690 --> 00:01:20.650
made a formal offer to Keanu Reeves for the
role of Kraven in his own standalone movie.

00:01:20.650 --> 00:01:25.660
To be clear, neither Sony nor Marvel have
responded to this rumor, so you're best taking

00:01:25.660 --> 00:01:27.630
it with a massive grain of salt.

00:01:27.630 --> 00:01:32.120
But if true, it would be the biggest development
for the Kraven the Hunter movie to date.

00:01:32.120 --> 00:01:36.500
On top of their potential casting scoop, the
rumor site also reported that the tone of

00:01:36.500 --> 00:01:38.890
the film will be a mix of Man on Fire and
Logan.

00:01:38.890 --> 00:01:43.361
The Illuminerdi stressed that this is only
an offer so far, however, and didn't give

00:01:43.361 --> 00:01:46.090
any indication of whether Reeves has accepted
or not.

00:01:46.090 --> 00:01:50.560
On at least one level, though, it is absolutely
true that Marvel Studios has courted Reeves

00:01:50.560 --> 00:01:52.220
for a number of projects.

00:01:52.220 --> 00:01:57.990
In 2019, Marvel president Kevin Feige told
ComicBook.com that many discussions with Reeves

00:01:57.990 --> 00:01:59.440
had taken place, and that:

00:01:59.440 --> 00:02:04.220
"I don't know when, if, or ever he'll join
the MCU, but we very much want to figure out

00:02:04.220 --> 00:02:05.500
the right way to do it."

00:02:05.500 --> 00:02:09.789
And while it would make sense that Sony might
want to nab a big star in the role, it's also

00:02:09.789 --> 00:02:13.860
unclear whether Kraven would be the Marvel
character Reeves would finally want to pick

00:02:13.860 --> 00:02:19.150
— particularly since the connection between
Sony's standalone flicks and the MCU remains

00:02:19.150 --> 00:02:20.150
unclear.

00:02:20.150 --> 00:02:24.260
Regardless, if Reeves were being courted for
this notoriously over-the-top character, it

00:02:24.260 --> 00:02:28.470
would be an entirely different beast from
the kind of roles he's generally associated

00:02:28.470 --> 00:02:29.470
with.

00:02:29.470 --> 00:02:33.760
It's worth saying again that this is a totally
unsubstantiated rumor, and neither Marvel

00:02:33.760 --> 00:02:35.959
nor Reeves have commented on it.

00:02:35.959 --> 00:02:40.480
Indeed, one reason to be skeptical is that
it's unclear whether the standalone film is

00:02:40.480 --> 00:02:44.970
moving forward at all, or if Sony is waiting
to see how Morbius fares, or — even more

00:02:44.970 --> 00:02:49.720
confusingly — whether Kraven might instead
appear in an MCU Spider-Man movie.

00:02:49.720 --> 00:02:55.270
After all, it was said that Sony was pursuing
that solo Mysterio film back in 2017, but

00:02:55.270 --> 00:02:58.080
the character instead appeared in Far From
Home.

00:02:58.080 --> 00:03:01.260
And then there's Reeves himself, who's a busy
guy to say the least.

00:03:01.260 --> 00:03:06.650
Among the most prominent of his upcoming projects
include The Matrix 4 in December 2021 and

00:03:06.650 --> 00:03:09.000
John Wick 4 in May 2022.

00:03:09.000 --> 00:03:11.680
"Yeah, I'm thinking I'm back."

00:03:11.680 --> 00:03:15.310
After that, he'll be appearing in a fifth
John Wick film.

00:03:15.310 --> 00:03:20.270
He's also involved with two more upcoming
films, Rally Car and Past Midnight, as well

00:03:20.270 --> 00:03:22.410
as the TV series Rain.

00:03:22.410 --> 00:03:26.660
Sony hasn't officially confirmed their Kraven
movie is happening at all, much less shared

00:03:26.660 --> 00:03:32.150
a timetable for the project, but if filming
was to take place before 2023, Reeves would

00:03:32.150 --> 00:03:36.470
have a difficult time fitting it into his
schedule — especially given the heavy demands

00:03:36.470 --> 00:03:38.360
of featuring in a Marvel film.

00:03:38.360 --> 00:03:42.890
And given how difficult it's been to bring
Reeves into the Marvel fold thus far, it might

00:03:42.890 --> 00:03:46.660
not be time to bust out the Kraven cosplay
just yet.

